<!-- ── the sample sheet ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Real output, not a mockup: officers of Fortune 500 fintech companies
     resolved from a name and a domain, then checked against the live mailbox.
     Addresses are masked — CsuiteFinderWeb.SampleSheet says why. One partial
     because three pages show it, and three copies of a table is three places
     to forget to change. -->
<div class="sheet-wrap">
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="sheet-bar">
      <span class="sheet-namebox">C3</span>
      <span class="sheet-fx">fx</span>
      <span class="sheet-formula"><%= Enum.at(@rows, 1).email %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="sheet-scroll">
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="colheads">
            <td class="corner"></td>
            <td class="col-head">A</td>
            <td class="col-head">B</td>
            <td class="col-head">C</td>
            <td class="col-head">D</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="titles">
            <td class="row-head">1</td>
            <td>Name</td>
            <td>Title</td>
            <td>Email</td>
            <td>Deliverable</td>
          </tr>
          <%= for {row, index} <- Enum.with_index(@rows) do %>
          <tr class="sheet-row <%= CsuiteFinderWeb.SampleSheet.row_class(row.status) %>">
            <td class="row-head"><%= index + 2 %></td>
            <td><%= row.name %> <span class="empty-cell">· <%= row.company %></span></td>
            <td class="title-cell"><%= row.title %></td>
            <td class="email<%= if index == 1, do: " active" %>"><%= row.email %><%= if index == 1 do %><span class="sheet-cursor" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 18" width="15" height="22"><path d="M1 1l9.2 8.1-4.2.3 2.3 5.2-2 .9-2.3-5.2-3 2.9z" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1f1f" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><% end %></td>
            <td class="st <%= CsuiteFinderWeb.SampleSheet.status_class(row.status) %>"><%= CsuiteFinderWeb.SampleSheet.mark(row.status) %> <%= CsuiteFinderWeb.SampleSheet.label(row.status) %></td>
          </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="sheet-foot">
      <div class="sheet-tabs">
        <span class="sheet-tab on">Prospects.csv</span>
        <span class="sheet-tab">Sheet2</span>
        <span class="sheet-tab">+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sheet-count"><%= @count %></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="sheet-note">
  Real lookups, run on <%= @date %>: a name and a company domain in, a work
  address and a job title out — and no two of these companies build their
  addresses the same way. Contact details are masked here because these are
  real people. <strong>Deliverable</strong> is the live mailbox check: the two
  marked otherwise are addresses you would have bounced, found before you sent.
</p>
